{"title": "疗养院在“治未病”中的优势", "authors": "聂怀利 ; 山东省泰山疗养院", "orgs": "", "source": "中国疗养医学", "year": "2009", "volume": "", "issue": "", "pages": "", "keywords": "", "abstract": "<正>祖国医学特别重视\"治未病\"的健康理念。在中医学的奠基之作《黄帝内经》中,关于这方面的论述有许多。《素问·四气调神大论》说:\"不治已病治未病,不治已乱", "doi": "10.13517/j.cnki.ccm.2009.05.009", "cited_count": "", "download_count": "", "fund": "", "classification": "", "clc_code": "R21", "url": "https://kns.cnki.net/kcms2/article/abstract?v=4Kwr3-EHKF66WJmC2SksDY6jWsT979X4TkSR8HJ1JslJxcFRIgIVr4zpa9U33TSCyfAg8GjxzX7TvIK808VtlLjd-LcgAXToP392wwKLcajMuuy3lTbaP0Wir0MfG2eEN9Dq6nSxXTn5DOlZhjm2w1UIEowANv4Op5v6IV6Pe8ckXnLih6x_Fg==&uniplatform=NZKPT&language=CHS", "uid": "07dd7c99a176"}
